NEWS for Midi66 0.2.0
Chris Ahlstrom
2024-04-15 to 2026-11-17

Version 0.2.0 is a heavy refactoring of the original code. Beware.
This revision now works for ALSA and JACK MIDI and MIDI Clock I/O.

# Changelog

## [0.2.0] - 2025-11-17

    This first version is meant to make meta events in a MIDI
    transcript even more human-readable.

    See the README.md for details and the TODO for the next changes.

### Added

- For meta events, we allow "KeySig" (for example), to be read/written
  instead of 0xFF 0xmm. That is, human readability is increased.

### Fixed

- None.

### Changed

- Derived midi::file from midi::filebase, which is also the same base
  class of midi::transcript.

### Removed

- None.

## [0.1.0] - 2025-11-17

    This first version is somewhat complete, and usable/installable.
    See the README.md for details and the TODO for the next changes.

### Added

- None.

### Fixed

- None.

### Changed

- None.

### Removed

- None.

